  "details": "World that was previously fine now fails to load after re-uploading due to not passing server side checks. World Id is `wrld_b320e506-6db1-45d9-8daa-466584d43f8c`. I've tested uploading with SDK's 3.8.0 and 3.9.0-beta.1 and neither work. The SDK does not complain about any issues, leaving me with no hint about what is failing.\n\n```\n\n2025.09.22 00:04:31 Error      -  [API] [531, 403, Get, -1 https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/analysis/file_b25715ea-6d63-408a-be18-a279972580c0/82/security] Abandoning request, because - File forbidden\n\n2025.09.22 00:04:31 Error      -  World 'wrld_b320e506-6db1-45d9-8daa-466584d43f8c' did not pass initial checks and won't be downloaded: 10\n\n2025.09.22 00:04:31 Error      -  Error Downloading or Instantiating Custom Scene - VOLT - SDK3 Work in Progress - 10\n\n```",
